          <p class="stormis-card-dark__desc">Single-origin dark chocolate pralines & cocoa truffles with sea salt & 24k gold.</p>
          <div class="stormis-card-dark__footer">
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__price">$36.00</span>
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__btn">View Details</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 3: Scandinavian Candy Mix -->
      <a href="/products/scandinavian-candy-mix" class="stormis-card-dark">
        <div class="stormis-card-dark__media">
          <span class="stormis-card-dark__badge">Artisan Mix</span>
          <img src="{{ 'prod-mix-main.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Scandinavian Candy Mix" class="stormis-card-dark__img stormis-card-dark__img--main" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400">
          <img src="{{ 'prod-mix-lifestyle.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Scandinavian Candy Mix Lifestyle" class="stormis-card-dark__img stormis-card-dark__img--hover" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400">
        </div>
        <div class="stormis-card-dark__body">
          <div style="color: #E5A93C; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px;">★★★★★ 4.9</div>
          <h3 class="stormis-card-dark__name">Scandinavian Candy Mix</h3>
          <p class="stormis-card-dark__desc">Sour raspberry skulls, sweet salmiak licorice diamonds, and fruit pastilles.</p>
          <div class="stormis-card-dark__footer">
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__price">$24.00</span>
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__btn">View Details</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- 4: Premium Swedish Gift Box -->
      <a href="/products/premium-gift-candy-box" class="stormis-card-dark">
        <div class="stormis-card-dark__media">
          <span class="stormis-card-dark__badge">Grand Gift</span>
          <img src="{{ 'prod-giftbox-main.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Premium Swedish Gift Box" class="stormis-card-dark__img stormis-card-dark__img--main" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400">
          <img src="{{ 'stormis-lifestyle-banner.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Premium Swedish Gift Box Lifestyle" class="stormis-card-dark__img stormis-card-dark__img--hover" loading="lazy" width="400" height="400">
        </div>
        <div class="stormis-card-dark__body">
          <div style="color: #E5A93C; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 4px;">★★★★★ 5.0</div>
          <h3 class="stormis-card-dark__name">Premium Swedish Gift Box</h3>
          <p class="stormis-card-dark__desc">Rigid keepsake gift hamper box with gold debossed emblem and full assortment.</p>
          <div class="stormis-card-dark__footer">
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__price">$65.00</span>
            <span class="stormis-card-dark__btn">View Details</span>
          </div>
        </div>
